OL,3,GNEWSADrivers hurl bottles of urine at
OL,4,Abridge workers 'just doing their jobs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers managing traffic at the Menai
OL,7,FSuspension Bridge have faced continued
OL,8,Fabuse from frustrated drivers,
OL,9,Fincluding a bottle of urine being
OL,10,Fthrown at them.
OL,12,FThe staff have been stationed at the
OL,13,F200-year-old structure in north Wales
OL,14,Fto prevent overweight (7.5 tonne)
OL,15,Fvehicles crossing while repair work
OL,16,Fcontinues.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
