OL,3,GNEWSADrivers hurl bottles of urine at
OL,4,Abridge workers 'just doing their jobs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey have reported bottles being hurled
OL,7,Ffrom cars, including one full of urine,
OL,8,Fvehicles being driven aggressively,
OL,9,Fverbal abuse and intrusive filming from
OL,10,Fmotorists. Workers have also withdrawn
OL,11,Fover safety concerns.
OL,13,FMark Hooper, the deputy minister for
OL,14,Ftransport, said there was "no place for
OL,15,Fharassment and bullying," and wanted
OL,16,Fthe workers to know "he has got their
OL,17,Fback."
